<p><a style="color: #007bff; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: normal;" href="https://www.at-school-portal.com/moodle/mod/lesson/view.php?id=2762"> <span class="multilang" lang="en">On to Challenge 3 &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ja">次ステップ「チャレンジ３」へ移動 &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ko">다음 단계 '챌린지 3'으로 이동 &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="es">Ir al siguiente paso: "Desafío 3" &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="de">Zum nächsten Schritt gehen: „Herausforderung 3“ &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="fr">Passer à l'étape suivante : « Défi 3 » &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="pt">Ir para o próximo passo: "Desafio 3" &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="bg">Преминете към следващата стъпка: „Предизвикателство 3“ &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ru">Перейти к следующему шагу: «Вызов 3» &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ar">الانتقال إلى الخطوة التالية: "التحدي 3" &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="hi">अगले चरण पर जाएँ: "चुनौती 3" &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="zh_tw">移动至下一步驟：「挑戰 3」 &gt;</span> <span class="multilang" lang="zh_cn">移动至下一步骤：「挑战 3」 &gt;</span> </a></p></div>";s:10:"customdata";a:2:{s:7:"display";s:1:"1";s:10:"filtericon";b:1;}}i:2762;O:8:"stdClass":19:{s:2:"id";s:2:"11";s:2:"cm";s:4:"2762";s:3:"mod";s:6:"lesson";s:7:"section";s:1:"1";s:13:"sectionnumber";s:1:"1";s:9:"sectionid";s:3:"128";s:6:"module";s:2:"14";s:5:"added";s:10:"1779570475";s:7:"visible";s:1:"1";s:19:"visibleoncoursepage";i:1;s:10:"visibleold";s:1:"1";s:10:"completion";s:1:"2";s:19:"completionpassgrade";s:1:"0";s:15:"showdescription";s:1:"1";s:15:"downloadcontent";s:1:"1";s:4:"lang";s:0:"";s:4:"name";s:31:"Challenge 3 - Greeting Match-up";s:7:"content";s:1417:"<div class="no-overflow"><a style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block;" href="https://www.at-school-portal.com/moodle/mod/lesson/view.php?id=2762">
