<h3 style="margin: 0; padding: 5px 0;"><span class="multilang" lang="en">Challenge 13 — Greetings Flashcards (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ja">チャレンジ 13 ― あいさつフラッシュカード (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ko">챌린지 13 — 인사말 플래시 카드 (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="es">Desafío 13: Tarjetas de vocabulario de saludos (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="de">Challenge 13 – Begrüßungs-Flashcards (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="fr">Défi 13 — Cartes mémoire des salutations (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="pt">Desafio 13 — Cartões de Memorização de Saudações (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="bg">Предизвикателство 13 — Флаш карти за поздрави (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ru">Испытание 13 — Карточки для запоминания приветствий (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ar">التحدي 13 — بطاقات استذكار التحيات (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="hi">चुनौती 13 — अभिवादन फ्लैशकार्ड (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="zh_tw">挑戰 13 ― 問候語 flashcards (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="zh_cn">挑战 13 ― 问候语 flashcards (10xp)</span></h3>
