<h3 style="margin: 0; padding: 5px 0;"><span class="multilang" lang="en">Challenge 14 — Mission 1 Reflection (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ja">チャレンジ 14 ― ミッション1 の振り返り (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ko">챌린지 14 — 미션 1 돌아보기 (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="es">Desafío 14: Reflexión de la Misión 1 (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="de">Challenge 14 – Mission 1 Reflexion (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="fr">Défi 14 — Réflexion sur la Mission 1 (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="pt">Desafio 14 — Reflexão da Missão 1 (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="bg">Предизвикателство 14 — Равносметка за Мисия 1 (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ru">Испытание 14 — Анализ итоги Миссии 1 (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ar">التحدي 14 — مراجعة المهمة 1 (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="hi">चुनौती 14 — मिशन 1 आत्म-चिंतन (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="zh_tw">挑戰 14 ― 任務 1 回顧 (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="zh_cn">挑战 14 ― 任务 1 回顾 (10xp)</span></h3>
